flowchart LR
    accTitle: Protected audit storage and SIEM
    accDescr: The application sends typed audit events to a remote collector. Under a separate administrative boundary, the collector forwards evidence to a retention-protected archive and a SIEM that correlates events and detects delivery gaps. The application cannot change archive retention or delete evidence.
    app["Application<br/>typed audit events"]
    subgraph protected["Separate administrative boundary"]
        collector["Remote collector<br/>authenticated delivery"]
        archive["Protected archive<br/>retention / WORM"]
        siem["SIEM<br/>correlation + gaps"]
        collector --> archive
        collector --> siem
    end
    app --> collector
    classDef source fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf,color:#17212b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef transport fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366,color:#17212b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef evidence fill:#e1d5e7,stroke:#9673a6,color:#17212b,stroke-width:2px
    class app source
    class collector transport
    class archive,siem evidence
